/*
  AIRestorePanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0201 · AIRestorePanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `AIRestorePanel` resolves (table "AIRestorePanel") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys from the web source
  (features/settings/components/AIRestorePanel.tsx). The second group is the
  per-feature label keys it resolves via `ai.settings.feature.${id}.label`, a
  verbatim port of the frozen `@/ai/features` name table (57 features). The third
  group backs the native chrome: the P4 leaf freshness / loading / empty / error
  copy, so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

